Subject: Effect of scaling affects significance in joint Poisson model
Message-ID: <a2hCjhQXo4M.xXYDXvcp3BAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/a2hCjhQXo4M/m/xXYDXvcp3BAJ>
